+A new method, :meth:`~falcon.App.set_error_reporter` (also available as
+:meth:`falcon.asgi.App.set_error_reporter`), makes it possible to observe every
+exception raised while the framework is processing a request, e.g., in order to
+log it, or to send it to an error tracker. The reporter is called before the
+matching error handler is invoked, and it is also told whether the exception is
+going to be handled by an error handler, or propagate to the application
+server.
